  "body": "When a promise-returning attribute getter is called on a wrong this value, it is expected to throw a type error. Promise-returning operations on the other side will return a rejected promise.\n\nI am wondering why attribute getters are not also rejecting.\nAlthough not WebIDL based, https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#default-reader-closed is doing so for instance.\n",
